# Checksums for the test CEL files, after decompression.
#
# Source: GEO series GSE224950 (platform GPL33111, Axiom_UKB_WCSG), deposited by
# the Powell lab at the Garvan Institute for Neavin et al. 2023 (PMID 37296104).
# The series has twenty hiPSC lines; these four are the subset used for the test,
# picked to cover both sexes so the sex calls in the .psam are exercised.
#
#   GSM7036154  iPSC_166       Female
#   GSM7036155  iPSC_180N      Female
#   GSM7036159  iPSC_IST3323   Male
#   GSM7036160  iPSC_MBE0953   Male
#
# GEO serves these gzipped and replaces supplementary files in place without
# changing the accession, so these are checksums of what GEO served on
# 2026-09-18 rather than anything the depositors or NCBI publish. A mismatch
# means the deposit has changed, not necessarily that the download is corrupt.
